1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
In the court of Ayodhyā, the
sage sat before the king.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
And Dasharatha had
already given his word.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
Before he asked, the sage
told him: keep your word.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,400
Far from here, in the forest,
Viśvāmitra had begun a yajña.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,700
Two rākṣasas kept breaking
it. Mārīca. Subāhu.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,600
They poured flesh and
blood over the altar.

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,400
He was under a vow. He
couldn't curse them.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
So he had come to the king.

9
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,700
Ten nights. That
was all he asked.

10
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,800
He did not ask for the army.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,100
Rāma.
